 {
  "key": "A bell only works if somebody rings it, clerk.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "A tag, a postcard, a house. Keep looking in.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "A ticket isn’t a ticket until it’s punched.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "A window frame decides where a train has arrived.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "An unclaimed tag always has another side.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Bellwether is a request stop. In 1978 you only had to ask.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "City, hawthorn, orchard. The lane only goes one way.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Claim 1978-0412. Every claim starts on a stub.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Go on through. The night is bigger than your office.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Her city window, her orchard window. One frame fits both.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Her office floor is torn today. It wasn’t in 1978.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Her stub still has the Conductor’s hole in it. Holes are for looking through.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Luggage falls down, clerk. Rack over arms.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "My punch leaves a hole. Holes are for looking through.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Open it once, then give it back its lid.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Plate IV. Rosa drew that lane. It deserves a closer look.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Platform, office, the drawing, the orchard. Put her day back in order.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "She always took the hill path down to the station.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "She stops where the floor is torn. In 1978 it was whole.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Someone polished that desk bell for a visitor. Look closer.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Step back a little. See the whole desk again.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "That hedge wasn’t there in 1978. Hold the old light on the gate.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "That was the counter bell. Bring the floor back to your desk.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The door to my car is past the window, not above it.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The key line runs when both of its ends are close enough to see.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The rest of the car is folded away underneath. Draw it out.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The tag says more in 1978 light.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The viaduct fell years ago. In 1978 it stood. Hold it there.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "They stamped the reservation FILED. In 1978 nobody had stamped it yet.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "This wall folds, clerk. There’s a second window tucked behind yours.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Your desk and that door don’t meet. Floors go where floors go.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Your ticket is in the pigeonholes, clerk. Tickets fall downhill.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/nightService/hintLines.js"
  ],
